{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"unreal-milky-sloth","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Summary\nCalling the `rebar-list_tickets` MCP tool (rebar MCP server) with `status=\"open\"`, `ticket_type=\"epic\"` consistently fails.\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n1. Invoke the `rebar-list_tickets` tool via the rebar MCP server with parameters `{\"status\": \"open\", \"ticket_type\": \"epic\"}`.\n2. Observe the response.\n\n## Actual result\nThe tool call returns immediately with:\n```\nThe execution of this tool, or a previous tool was interrupted.\n```\nNo ticket data is returned. Reproduced twice in a row with identical parameters, same result each time.\n\n## Expected result\nThe tool should return the list of open epic tickets (or an empty list if none exist).\n\n## Environment\n- Client: GitHub Copilot CLI (session in /Users/joeoakhart/rebar)\n- rebar MCP server, invoked via `rebar-list_tickets`\n- Repo: navapbc/rebar\n\n## Impact\nBlocks the \"route tracker ops through MCP\" workflow mandated by AGENTS.md — cannot list/filter tickets via MCP for this query shape.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Root cause of the \"execution ... interrupted\" response identified (e.g., server-side exception, timeout, schema/argument validation issue, or client-side harness truncation).\n- [ ] `rebar-list_tickets` with `status=\"open\"` and `ticket_type=\"epic\"` returns a valid ticket list (or documented empty result) without the interrupted error.\n- [ ] Regression coverage added if the root cause is in rebar's MCP server code.\n","id":"6fe7-956f-4901-45cf","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"rebar-list_tickets MCP tool call fails with \"execution interrupted\""},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787856371950409998,"uuid":"535956d8-5689-43ef-8510-a8e35c51a854"}